{"id":"huntik:page:6738","page_id":6738,"title":"Stoneblade","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Stoneblade is a spell that manifests a moving blade of energy through the ground to send towards the target.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:Stoneblade_2.png","wikitext":"File:Stoneblade_2.png","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Blue\nYellow","wikitext":"Blue <br> Yellow","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Offensive","wikitext":"Offensive","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Grier\nUnnamed Suit 040","wikitext":"[[Grier]] <br> [[Unnamed Suit 040]]","links":[{"target_title":"Grier","label":"Grier","target_id":"huntik:page:2046","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Grier","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2046"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 040","label":"Unnamed Suit 040","target_id":"huntik:page:18801","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_040","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A18801"}]},"first":{"text":"Ladies' Choice","wikitext":"[[Ladies' Choice]]","links":[{"target_title":"Ladies' Choice","label":"Ladies' Choice","target_id":"huntik:page:3572","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Ladies%27_Choice","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3572"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:Stoneblade_2.png","value_text":"File:Stoneblade_2.png","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Blue <br> Yellow","value_text":"Blue\nYellow","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Offensive","value_text":"Offensive","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Grier]] <br> [[Unnamed Suit 040]]","value_text":"Grier\nUnnamed Suit 040","links":[{"target_title":"Grier","label":"Grier","target_id":"huntik:page:2046","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Grier","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2046"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 040","label":"Unnamed Suit 040","target_id":"huntik:page:18801","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_040","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A18801"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"[[Ladies' Choice]]","value_text":"Ladies' Choice","links":[{"target_title":"Ladies' Choice","label":"Ladies' Choice","target_id":"huntik:page:3572","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Ladies%27_Choice","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3572"}]}],"start":0,"end":172}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This spell was used by [[unnamed Suit 040]] against the [[Amazons]] and later [[Sophie Casterwill]] when [[the Organization]] was after [[Hippolyta]]'s [[Ring]] of [[Behemoth]]. {{source|Ladies' Choice}} \n\nThe same Suit later used it against [[Montehue]] in [[King Solomon's mines]], but he dodged the attack. {{source|To Be Together}}\n\nWhen Stoneblade was used by [[Grier]] while storming [[the Professor's castle]], he instead manifested a yellow aura. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}\n\n{{clear}}","text":"This spell was used by unnamed Suit 040 against the Amazons and later Sophie Casterwill when the Organization was after Hippolyta's Ring of Behemoth. [Ladies' Choice]\n\nThe same Suit later used it against Montehue in King Solomon's mines, but he dodged the attack. [To Be Together]\n\nWhen Stoneblade was used by Grier while storming the Professor's castle, he instead manifested a yellow aura. [An Ally from the Organization]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"<gallery captionalign=\"left\">\nStoneblade 2.png\nStoneblade 1.png|The Amazons are knocked back by the power\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Yellow-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","text":"Image caption: The Amazons are knocked back by the power"}],"full_text":"Stoneblade is a spell that manifests a moving blade of energy through the ground to send towards the target.\n\nHistory\n\nThis spell was used by unnamed Suit 040 against the Amazons and later Sophie Casterwill when the Organization was after Hippolyta's Ring of Behemoth. [Ladies' Choice]\n\nThe same Suit later used it against Montehue in King Solomon's mines, but he dodged the attack. [To Be Together]\n\nWhen Stoneblade was used by Grier while storming the Professor's castle, he instead manifested a yellow aura. [An Ally from the Organization]\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: The Amazons are knocked back by the power","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:Stoneblade_2.png\n| aura  = Blue <br> Yellow\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Grier]] <br> [[Unnamed Suit 040]]\n| first = [[Ladies' Choice]]\n}}\n'''Stoneblade''' is a spell that manifests a moving blade of energy through the ground to send towards the target.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by [[unnamed Suit 040]] against the [[Amazons]] and later [[Sophie Casterwill]] when [[the Organization]] was after [[Hippolyta]]'s [[Ring]] of [[Behemoth]]. {{source|Ladies' Choice}} \n\nThe same Suit later used it against [[Montehue]] in [[King Solomon's mines]], but he dodged the attack. {{source|To Be Together}}\n\nWhen Stoneblade was used by [[Grier]] while storming [[the Professor's castle]], he instead manifested a yellow aura. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}\n\n{{clear}}\n==Gallery==\n<gallery captionalign=\"left\">\nStoneblade 2.png\nStoneblade 1.png|The Amazons are knocked back by the power\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Yellow-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","categories":["Blue-aura spells","Magic","Offensive spells","Organization magic","Yellow-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:2046","status":"resolved","target_title":"Grier","label":"Grier","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Grier","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2046"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:18801","status":"resolved","target_title":"Unnamed Suit 040","label":"Unnamed Suit 040","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_040","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A18801"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3572","status":"resolved","target_title":"Ladies' Choice","label":"Ladies' Choice","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Ladies%27_Choice","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3572"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:18801","status":"resolved","target_title":"unnamed Suit 040","label":"unnamed Suit 040","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/unnamed_Suit_040","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A18801"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:5617","status":"resolved","target_title":"Amazons","label":"Amazons","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Amazons","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5617"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2041","status":"resolved","target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3497","status":"resolved","target_title":"Hippolyta","label":"Hippolyta","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Hippolyta","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3497"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2986","status":"resolved","target_title":"Ring","label":"Ring","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Ring","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2986"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2426","status":"resolved","target_title":"Behemoth","label":"Behemoth","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Behemoth","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2426"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2827","status":"resolved","target_title":"Montehue","label":"Montehue","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Montehue","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2827"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8011","status":"resolved","target_title":"King Solomon's mines","label":"King Solomon's mines",